## Changed

- Replaced per-frame detached root fibers with a connection-owned Effect queue worker, so frame parsing and command handling are serialized in the connection scope.
- Preserved tagged coordinator command codes at the socket boundary instead of converting all command failures to `PROVIDER_FAILURE`.
- Replaced coordinator `Effect.exit`-based sample and transport classification with typed `Effect.match` handling. Typed provider failures continue to degrade/recover the lane; interruption and defects are no longer converted to ordinary provider failures.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/server.ts`.

